s_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"\nType: <b>Bug</b>\n\nWhen I type a prompt into chat, some symbols trigger attaching items to context (such as #, followed by a file name, will attach a file, or #changes will attach git changes).\n\nHowever, if I copy that text (right click / context menu), and paste it into a new chat, some of those special symbols lose their meaning.\n\nSpecifically, files will not be attached to context after pasting. I have to re-type `#<file name>` to get the file attached to context again.\n\nPlease improve round-tripping on copied chat text! Thank you!\n\nExtension version: 0.28.2025052701\nVS Code version: Code - Insiders 1.101.0-insider (Universal) (747d0bd66a4699a53e720cf7a61dcd10f664e667, 2025-05-23T06:35:04.132Z)\nOS version: Darwin arm64 24.5.0\nModes:\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"vs-code-engineering[bot]","id":122617954,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOB08AYg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/281319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vs-code-engineering","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"pub